<title>POLAND: ELPO 1-TO-5 SHARE SPLIT ON APRIL 29.</title>
<headline>ELPO 1-TO-5 SHARE SPLIT ON APRIL 29.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Elpo SA one-to-five share split will be conducted on April 29, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Currently Elpo has 756,730 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
